#: kwalletbackend/backendpersisthandler.cpp:395
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Error when attempting to initialize OpenPGP while attempting to save the "
"wallet <b>%1</b>. Error code is <b>%2</b>. Please fix your system "
